WEBVTT

00:00:52.553 --> 00:00:56.887
The reason I jumped out the window

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:03.695
Was because the deep blue sky
was so clear

00:01:05.132 --> 00:01:09.262
I was still uncertain about
the self I couldn't see

00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:16.072
So I plunged out here, barefoot

00:01:17.211 --> 00:01:22.916
There are things I can't explain
or do well

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:28.786
That lie beyond the mirror
that I stare at so intently

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:35.295
So I put my rumpled-up dream
in my pocket

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:42.403
And make a promise to myself in the sky,
ten years from now

00:01:42.403 --> 00:01:48.008
The future I've always believed in
is no mistake

00:01:48.008 --> 00:01:54.381
Because I'm sure I have stronger
feelings than anyone else

00:01:54.381 --> 00:01:58.613
Tenderly

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:55.107
Bye-bye! *
Adieu, Spirit of Misfortune!

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:48.227
Closed
For the Day

