00:16:01.828 --> 00:16:06.822
Nurse's Office

00:22:22.475 --> 00:22:26.879
I can't lose heart,
but I'm not frantic either

00:22:26.879 --> 00:22:30.316
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:22:30.316 --> 00:22:35.288
With extraordinary effort
and a little miracle

00:22:35.288 --> 00:22:39.748
I get the feeling that it'll be
rosy and shining soon

00:22:41.627 --> 00:22:46.165
My life in Tokyo is so smooth,
don't I look chic?

00:22:46.165 --> 00:22:49.402
I even did research
on the most trendy clothes

00:22:49.402 --> 00:22:54.006
Now clubs recognize me
and just let me in

00:22:54.006 --> 00:22:58.110
My favorites are my mini-skirts

00:22:58.110 --> 00:23:01.781
It's important to
bond with my friends

00:23:01.781 --> 00:23:05.651
So of course I have a cell phone

00:23:05.651 --> 00:23:13.292
I got it by working hard at a job
that I can't talk about

00:23:13.292 --> 00:23:17.396
I can't lose heart,
but I'm not frantic either

00:23:17.396 --> 00:23:21.067
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:21.067 --> 00:23:23.202
I don't know what I want to do

00:23:23.202 --> 00:23:30.574
It seems these facts of loneliness
keep pouring down

00:23:32.912 --> 00:23:36.982
I don't know why I feel so sad,
I can't even cry

00:23:36.982 --> 00:23:40.653
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:40.653 --> 00:23:45.491
When I hear "How are you holding up"
in that familiar voice

00:23:45.491 --> 00:23:50.053
It feels like something's
tugging at my heartstrings

00:23:54.233 --> 00:24:19.191
Next Happy Lesson

00:24:19.191 --> 00:24:24.128
Next Happy Lesson
Unsteady *
